WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The GPU performs many calculations at once.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
A circuit board connects it to the rest of the computer.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The server adds the main processor, memory, and cooling.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
In this example, each server has eight GPUs.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
Four servers hold 32 GPUs.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The network lets those servers work together as a cluster.
